Test-PermissionCoverage
Every page, query, report and xmlport is granted by an assignable permission set.
Test-ObjectIdsUnique
Object ID uniqueness check passed: no duplicate object type and ID within any app.
Test-MessageTypeNames
Every message type name in the app has exactly three parts (6 checked; test apps are exempt).
Test-IcelandicXlfInSync
The committed is-IS.xlf is what tools/Update-IcelandicXlf.ps1 generates from the build.
Test-MixedLanguageLabels
No procedure answers a Locked English sentence.
Test-ContractParameterKeys
Every contract parameter is a key the code reads, and every key the code reads is declared (0 allow-listed).
Test-NoClientCallstack
No call stack is returned or documented to callers.
Test-ValidatedTableView
Every applied tableView is validated first.
Test-NoObsolete
No obsolete declaration and no AL0432/AL0667 pragma in the app, apart from the allow-listed VAT Amount Line pragmas.
Test-IcelandicKeywordCounts
Every Icelandic keyword list has at least as many entries as the English one (6 in the source, 6 in the xlf).
